{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"dwarf_house","model_identifier":"dwarf_house","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# dwarf_house\n\nDwarf house: a squat block house of dark dressed stone, a flat roof with a low parapet and chimney, a heavy iron-banded door under a thick lintel. Neutral.\n\n- Footprint: 6 x 6 columns (96 x 96 units, 2.70 x 2.70 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -42..42, y 0..114, z -40..38 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 43, construction_0 19, construction_33 28, construction_66 32, ruined 15 (2 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 80 x 112 x 72 centred at the origin\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `dwarf_house_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `dwarf_house_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_dwarf_house` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -45)\n- `fx_smoke` at (24, 115, 18)\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"h_found","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-42.0,0.0,-38.0],"to":[42.0,4.0,38.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[62.0,218.0,146.0,222.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[80.0,223.0,156.0,227.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[62.0,218.0,146.0,222.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[80.0,223.0,156.0,227.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,124.0,84.0,200.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,124.0,84.0,200.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"4c04823a-0738-5eea-bfd0-14765219fa10"},{"name":"h_w0_n","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-40.0,4.0,-36.0],"to":[40.0,90.0,-32.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[16.0,0.0,96.0,86.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[160.0,0.0,164.0,86.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[16.0,0.0,96.0,86.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[160.0,0.0,164.0,86.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[146.0,218.0,226.0,222.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[146.0,218.0,226.0,222.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"c597dc18-778d-54d0-97a7-fd65da688420"},{"name":"h_w0_s","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-40.0,4.0,32.0],"to":[40.0,90.0,36.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[16.0,0.0,96.0,86.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[164.0,0.0,168.0,86.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[16.0,0.0,96.0,86.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[164.0,0.0,168.0,86.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,223.0,80.0,227.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,223.0,80.0,227.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"94b46c10-82bb-554f-a9ee-884e12f40140"},{"name":"h_w0_w","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_